WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.716 --> 00:00:07.706
Every course concept in plain words, week by week, together with the scholars behind the readings.

2
00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:15.437
Search every concept. Type any term and matching definitions appear, each carrying the citation it comes from.

3
00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:23.966
Or browse by week. Each week lists its concepts and the scholars assigned that week, so you can revisit the fuller context.

4
00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:34.168
Note the perspective pills. Scholars carry WESTERN or INDIGENOUS pills so you always know whose knowledge you are using and can attribute it properly.

5
00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:41.456
Follow a scholar to their reading. Click a scholar's name to open the details of the source they wrote.

6
00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:44.058
Nothing here is graded.

7
00:00:44.058 --> 00:00:48.804
Where next: Turn concepts into memory with Concept Flashcards.
